Spanish-English-French-German-Italian Pascal word equivalencies For IP Pascal.

This file contains the word equivalences for words used in the parser proper.
It does not cover library names, options or other words.

This file is ISO 8859-1. The characters must be:

   ç (cedilla) 
   é (e with accent) 
   è (e with grave accent)

The equivalent form without accents or punctuation will be accepted. For
example, «ecrire» will be accepted for «écrire», «jusqua» for «justquá».

[1] Indicates a note. Typically this is only found on words that cannot be found
in a dictionary, abbreviations or contractions.

Keywords:

English          Espanol       Françis          Italian     German
===================================================================
and              yl[16]         et                          und
array            vector[10]     tableau                     oder
begin            inicio         début                       begin[12]
case             caso           cas                         fall
const            const          const                       konst[11]
div              div            div
do               haz            faire
downto           baja           basá[2]
else             sino           sinon
end              fin            fin
file             archivo        fichier
for              para           pour
function         funcion        fonction
goto             vesa           allerá[1]
if               si             si
in               en             en
label            etiqueta       étiquette
mod              res            mod[14]
nil              nulo           nul
not              no             non
of               de             de
or               ol[17]         ou
packed           empaquetado    paquet
